# Earned Knowledge

Evidence-backed findings discovered while operating this project's
control harness -- domain facts, process gotchas, verified API/tool
behavior -- worth remembering across milestones and sessions, distinct
from `decisions.md` (raw user decisions) and `spec.md` (formalized
requirements).

A distinct Harness Maintainer role may append here (per
HARNESS_GOVERNANCE.md's "Automatically mutable control-harness scope")
but must never edit deliverable source/tests or user requirements.

Add one file per topic as knowledge accumulates (e.g.
`knowledge/github-api-rate-limits.md`, `knowledge/fulcra-schema-notes.md`)
rather than growing a single unstructured file indefinitely. This file
itself is just the placeholder that keeps `knowledge/` present in a
fresh scaffold -- delete this line once real knowledge files exist.
